{"ld": 1292, "paper": "SP522", "session": "132", "title": "An Act to Codify the Maine Turnpike Authority's Contributions to the Highway Fund with Regard to the Sensible Transportation Policy Act", "sponsor_id": "s-brenner-stacy", "cosponsor_ids": ["s-bennett-richard", "s-black-russell", "h-carlow-nathan", "h-dill-james", "h-ducharme-john", "h-eaton-holly", "h-hepler-allison", "h-montell-karen", "h-ray-d"], "committee_code": "TRA", "committee_name": "Transportation", "summary": {"text": "This bill specifies that the Maine Turnpike Authority must contribute, on a quarterly basis, to the Highway Fund any revenues and reserves exceeding the sum of the authority's legislatively approved operating budget, reserve maintenance fund, debt services fund and debt service reserve fund, the amount required to support the debt service, any additional amount required to be kept in reserve, any additional amount allocated to a planning or capital project outside the authority's general maintenance and preservation duty that has been legislatively approved and approved by the Department of Transportation and found to be a greater priority than any other department projects and to be consistent with the Sensible Transportation Policy Act.", "official": true, "source": "Bill text, https://legislature.maine.gov/legis/bills/getPDF.asp?paper=SP0522&item=1&snum=132"}, "status": "died", "status_label": "Accepted Majority (ONTP) Report", "final_disposition": {"label": "Accepted Majority (ONTP) Report", "date": "2025-05-29", "governor_action": null, "governor_action_date": null}, "fiscal_status": "Not Yet Determined", "documents": [{"label": "Bill text (LD 1292)", "url": "https://legislature.maine.gov/legis/bills/getPDF.asp?paper=SP0522&item=1&snum=132", "item": 1}, {"label": "Amendment C-A (S-165)", "url": "https://legislature.maine.gov/legis/bills/getPDF.asp?paper=SP0522&item=2&snum=132", "item": 2}], "amendments": [{"id": "C-A (S-165)", "description": "Change Title", "sponsor": null, "sta